**Recommendation:** 
- Only return necessary data
- Mask or omit sensitive fields based on authorization level

```javascript
app.get('/users', authenticateToken, (req, res) => {
  const sanitizedUsers = users.map(user => ({
    id: user.id,
    name: user.name,
    // Only include email if user has permission
